ODK Collect
-----------
This package translates code from ODK Collect
(https://github.com/getodk/collect), Copyright (C) 2009-2017 University of
Washington, Copyright 2016-2019 Nafundi and the ODK Collect contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. ODK Collect ships no NOTICE
file.

tool/golden/Golden.java re-implements ODK Collect's `EncryptionUtils` on
the JVM to produce test vectors; tool/golden/forms/ and the forms embedded
in test/src/golden_fixtures.dart are ODK Collect test forms, unmodified.
